      "changelog": "- Updated expiry and retention details for threads: now clarifies a best-effort 60-second receipt grace period before sweeping, with no guaranteed retention.\n- Expanded and updated descriptions of available tools for each interface; local MCP now offers 22 tools and can settle a send whose outcome never arrived.\n- Clarified that on hosted MCP, signature verification claims (`verified`, `from`) are service-provided, not locally checked.\n- Small clarifications to storage limits and thread duration (maximum one hour, not for storage or large payloads).\n- Removed the file skill-card.md.",
